// bastion (SEASON-1, row 42): the day-of-year event schedule — the
// in-game mirror of the real-world Calendar's holiday set
// (common/src/time.rs::SeasonalSchedule). Days are 0-based ordinals
// into the season_config.ron year (160 days: spring 0-39, summer
// 40-79, autumn 80-119, winter 120-159). MECHANISM-PROOF entries only —
// real festival content lands with DF-FESTIVAL, which subscribes to
// this schedule; entries here are the done-when's own two examples
// (harvest = an autumn day; a holy-day).
(
    events: {
        "harvest": 90,
        "holy_day": 20,
    },
)
